1. Scope of this file
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Apache-2.0 section 4(d) requires that a redistributor propagate the attribution
notices carried in the NOTICE file of any Apache-2.0 work included in a
derivative work. This file discharges that obligation.

It is deliberately not a full third-party licence listing. That is
`THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt`, regenerated from the installed dependency tree with
`node scripts/license-gate.mjs --write-third-party-notices` (design v3 section
10.2; a CycloneDX SBOM at release time is tracked separately). This file
carries only what Apache-2.0 section 4(d) and MPL-2.0 section 3.4 actually
require to be reproduced.

